    "Prop_FontFamily": "Font",
    "Prop_FontFamily_Desc": "Used throughout the widget — granularity, dates, shortcuts, calendar and control panel. Font size is still configurable per zone (under \"Zones\").",
    "Prop_BackgroundColor": "Main background",
    "Prop_BackgroundColor_Desc": "The widget's own background, behind every zone. Each zone (below, under \"Zones\") has its own independent background and boxes — this is just what shows where no zone has a box of its own.",
    "Prop_BackgroundOpacity": "Main background opacity (%)",
    "Prop_HoverRevealOpacity": "Expandable area opacity (%)",
    "Prop_HoverRevealOpacity_Desc": "Only applies with \"Show only on hover\" enabled (Display Mode). Controls the opacity of the blank space left while Shortcuts/Calendar/Control panel are hidden — each of those zones keeps its own background (under \"Zones\") once revealed.",
