    "Card_GranularityOptions": "Visible Granularities",
    "Card_GranularityOptions_Desc": "Each granularity: whether it's visible, the minimum points for automatic granularity to pick it, and the text shown on its button (blank = automatic, translated per the report's language).",
    "Prop_AutoGranularity": "Automatic granularity",
    "Prop_AutoGranularity_Desc": "On: the granularity picked above is only a suggestion — if the selected range has too few points at that level (or that level is turned off), it automatically steps down to the next available level. The calendar shown never changes on its own; only the effective filter sent to other visuals may differ from the level you clicked. Off: always forces the picked level, with no downgrade. This is the starting value — if the switch below is visible, the viewer can change this during the session.",
    "Prop_ShowAutoGranToggle": "Show Automatic/Manual switch to the viewer",
    "Prop_ShowAutoGranToggle_Desc": "Shows, inside the picker itself, a switch letting report viewers toggle between automatic and manual granularity. The choice isn't saved — it always resets to the \"Automatic granularity\" value above when the report is reopened.",
